      ],
      "impact": "The TXD2 net connects different physical bus pins on the two 2x15 connectors, breaking the intended pass-through behavior. A stacked module expecting TXD2 on pin 15 may not receive it, and the board may drive an unintended pin, causing UART/serial-servo operation to fail or misbehave.",
